// SetSync: Configure the managed sync that turns organization memberships, org roles and groups into FGA
// tuples, so a model can say `viewer: member from organization` without mirroring anything by
// hand. Opt-in per instance; nothing is written until `enabled` is true with a `store_id`.
// Enabling starts from the current end of the change feed and queues a backfill. The sync only
// ever removes tuples it wrote; a tuple that existed first is left alone. Tuples the store's model
// has no relation for are skipped and counted. A store or a tuple name cannot change while the
// sync owns tuples (409): disable it and `POST /v1/fga/sync/purge` first. Emits nothing itself;
// its writes emit fga.tuple_written and fga.tuple_deleted.
